| !Run for Folio (RiscPC build), a reader for PDF and ebook files.
| Built for a StrongARM RiscPC with GCCSDK GCC 4.7.4 (UnixLib, soft float),
| statically linked with MuPDF 1.28.5, and converted to an Absolute file.
| It has no plugins: no reading aloud and no text recognition.
Set Folio$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Folio$Dir>.!Sprites

| --- Processor -------------------------------------------------------
| The program uses StrongARM (ARMv4) instructions, which an ARM610 or ARM710
| doesn't have.
RMEnsure UtilityModule 3.50 Error Folio needs RISC OS 3.5 or later.

| --- Runtime support -------------------------------------------------
| GCCSDK's SharedUnixLibrary, in !Folio; a newer copy in !System wins.
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad <Folio$Dir>.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Folio needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later.

| --- Toolbox ---------------------------------------------------------
RMEnsure Toolbox 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Toolbox
RMEnsure Toolbox 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Toolbox (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure Window 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Window
RMEnsure Window 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Window (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure Menu 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Menu
RMEnsure Menu 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Menu (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure Iconbar 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Iconbar
RMEnsure Iconbar 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Iconbar (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure ProgInfo 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.ProgInfo
RMEnsure ProgInfo 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module ProgInfo (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure SaveAs 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.SaveAs
RMEnsure SaveAs 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module SaveAs (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure DCS 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.DCS_Quit
RMEnsure DCS 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module DCS (in !System, or the RISC OS 5 ROM).
| Only for Print... (Folio says so then if it's missing).
RMEnsure PrintDbox 0 IfThere System:Modules.Toolbox.PrintDbox Then RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.PrintDbox

| --- Memory ---------------------------------------------------------
| MuPDF's cache and the page pictures go in a dynamic area, "Folio Heap"
| (up to 64 MB), removed when Folio quits. The WimpSlot only holds the
| program itself (about 11 MB). Choices go in <Choices$Write>.Folio.
WimpSlot -min 11264K -max 11264K
| A log of what Folio did goes in <Wimp$ScrapDir>.FolioLog.
Run <Folio$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
